{"id":50836,"date":"2026-08-26T10:00:00","date_gmt":"2026-08-26T09:00:00","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/trilho-dos-linces\/"},"modified":"2026-09-03T01:29:23","modified_gmt":"2026-09-03T00:29:23","slug":"trilho-dos-linces","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/trilho-dos-linces\/","title":{"rendered":"Trilho dos Linces 2026"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style>\n<p><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Trilho dos Linces 2026<\/span><\/h2>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">O <strong>Trilho dos Linces 2026<\/strong> (<em>Trilho dos Linces by Goldenergy<\/em>) realiza-se no domingo, <strong>8 de Novembro de 2026<\/strong>, na freguesia de <strong>Lordelo<\/strong>, concelho e distrito de <strong>Vila Real<\/strong>. Organizado pela prestigiada <strong>Equipa Linces do Mar\u00e3o<\/strong> (Trilhos Semelhantes &#8211; Associa\u00e7\u00e3o) em estreita parceria com o <strong>Munic\u00edpio de Vila Real<\/strong> e as juntas de freguesia da serra, a prova \u00e9 um dos maiores desafios de montanha de Tr\u00e1s-os-Montes e do Norte de Portugal.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">Com concentra\u00e7\u00e3o e secretariado em Lordelo, os percursos desbravam as imponentes encostas da <strong>Serra do Alv\u00e3o<\/strong> e as cristas do Mar\u00e3o. O programa arranca com o <strong>Ultra Trilho (50 km \/ 2800m D+)<\/strong> \u00e0s <strong>07h30<\/strong>, o <strong>Trilho Longo (35 km \/ 1900m D+)<\/strong> \u00e0s <strong>08h30<\/strong>, o <strong>Trail Sprint (21 km \/ 1100m D+)<\/strong> \u00e0s <strong>09h00<\/strong>, o <strong>Mini Trilho (12 km \/ 600m D+)<\/strong> \u00e0s <strong>09h30<\/strong> e a <strong>Caminhada (12 km)<\/strong> \u00e0s <strong>10h15<\/strong>. As dist\u00e2ncias principais integram os Circuitos Nacionais da ATRP, pontuam para o \u00edndice UTMB\/ITRA e contam com refor\u00e7os refor\u00e7ados e medalha finisher.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2>\n<ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\">\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Data &#038; Hor\u00e1rio<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8